        <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="cdif.bbr.metadata.bioschemasProperties.cdifBioschemasProperties.BioschemasProperties.comment" xmi:uuid="9bb04ec4-09d4-5110-97c4-61bbffcecb6e">
          <body>**CDIF**

Definition
==========

Bioschemas classes and properties for laboratory workflow provenance in CDIF. Defines types and properties from the Bioschemas vocabulary and the ARC Workflow Run RO-Crate profile for describing lab processes, protocols, samples, parameters, equipment, and computational tools.
:title: "CDIF Bioschemas Properties"
:prefix: ``bios``</body>
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="cdif.bbr.metadata.bioschemasProperties.cdifBioschemasProperties.BioschemasProperties"/>
        </ownedComment>
        <ownedAttribute xmi:type="uml:Property" xmi:id="cdif.bbr.metadata.bioschemasProperties.cdifBioschemasProperties.BioschemasProperties.executesLabProtocol" xmi:uuid="bb42e29d-33b2-5416-9c67-178573f083f2">
          <name>executesLabProtocol</name>
          <type xmi:idref="cdif.bbr.metadata.bioschemasProperties.cdifBioschemasProperties.LabProtocol"/>
          <lowerValue xmi:type="uml:LiteralInteger" xmi:id="cdif.bbr.metadata.bioschemasProperties.cdifBioschemasProperties.BioschemasProperties.executesLabProtocol.lower" xmi:uuid="053c16d7-52bf-5c64-8898-8883476dc7a3">
            <value>0</value>
          </lowerValue>
          <upperValue xmi:type="uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural" xmi:id="cdif.bbr.metadata.bioschemasProperties.cdifBioschemasProperties.BioschemasProperties.executesLabProtocol.upper" xmi:uuid="43f5fed8-43a2-5e47-96fe-1a12555c1406">
            <value>1</value>
          </upperValue>
          <association xmi:idref="cdif.bbr.metadata.bioschemasProperties.cdifBioschemasProperties.assoc.BioschemasProperties_executesLabProtocol_LabProtocol"/>
          <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="cdif.bbr.metadata.bioschemasProperties.cdifBioschemasProperties.BioschemasProperties.executesLabProtocol.comment" xmi:uuid="825e5f35-d2ab-51f0-ac79-99383a3aa5fe">
            <body>**CDIF**

Definition
==========

The laboratory protocol executed by this process. Links a LabProcess activity to the LabProtocol it follows. In cdifProvActivity, also mapped to schema:actionProcess for compatibility.
:inlineOrByReference: ``inline``
:idRefDescription: "reference to a LabProtocol defined elsewhere"
:orReference: ["value", "idReference"]</body>
            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="cdif.bbr.metadata.bioschemasProperties.cdifBioschemasProperties.BioschemasProperties.executesLabProtocol"/>
          </ownedComment>
        </ownedAttribute>
